# .agents/docs is NOT a directory: it is a junction (PC) / symlink (m1) into the SOTR
# Obsidian vault -- "My Drive/Start of The Road/x/Agent Docs". Git on Linux refuses by
# design to descend into a symlinked directory, so WSL reported all 1256 tracked files
# as deleted while Windows git reported them as modified: same tree, two verdicts, and
# ~1087 files of permanent CRLF/LF churn. The SOTR vault's own repo is now the single
# owner of these docs (dev, 2026-08-15). Supersedes the Drive sync conflict-copy rule
# added 2026-07-02, which this subsumes.
.agents/docs
